 text-foreground leading-snug mb-1.5","children":"BHK 412 000 → 440 000, MIH 1 271 000 → 1 360 000"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed","children":"2026-yil 1-sentabridan ikkala bazaviy miqdor 2026-yil 23-iyundagi PF-115 Farmoni bilan 7% ga oshirildi: bazaviy hisoblash kattaligi 412 000 dan 440 000 so'mgacha, minimal ish haqi 1 271 000 dan 1 360 000 so'mgacha. BHK qonun uning kratlarida belgilagan hamma narsani qayta baholaydi: OSAGOsiz haydash uchun jarima 440 000 so'm bo'ldi, yuridik shaxsni ro'yxatdan o'tkazish boji — 440 000 so'm, QQS bo'yicha majburiy ro'yxatdan o'tish chegarasi (12 000 BHK) — 5 280 000 000 so'm. MIH dan JShShS imtiyozlari hisoblanadi: moddiy yordam (4,22 MIH) yiliga 5 739 200 so'mgacha, ipotekani to'lash imtiyozi (80 MIH) — 108 800 000 so'mgacha oshdi. Barcha kalkulyatorlar, maqolalar, FAQ va hisob misollari qayta hisoblandi."}]]}],["$","article","1",{"className":"rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-5","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground leading-snug mb-1.5","children":"BHK ni Vazirlar Mahkamasi qarori emas, Prezident Farmoni belgilaydi"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed","children":"FAQ ning o'zbekcha versiyasida BHK Vazirlar Mahkamasi qarori bilan yangilanadi deb yozilgan edi. Aslida BHK miqdori Prezident Farmoni bilan belgilanadi — xuddi shu maqolaning ruscha versiyasida to'g'ri ko'rsatilgan. Ta'riflar bir xillashtirildi."}]]}]]}]]}],["$","section","2026-08-31",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-lg font-semibold text-foreground mb-5 pb-2 border-b border-border","children":"2026-yil 31-avgust"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-3","children":[["$","article","0",{"className":"rounded-xl border border-border bg-card p-5","children":["$L14","$L15"]}],"$L16","$L17","$L18"]}]]}],"$L19","$L1a","$L1b","$L1c","$L1d","$L1e","$L1f","$L20","$L21","$L22","$L23"]}],"$L24"]}]
